  "name": "Dreamliner livery (2018)",
  "kind": "standard",
  "from": "2018",
  "confidence": "medium",
  "drawnOn": "B789",
  "description": "Tahiti blue over a white belly from the nose to mid-body, with two thin red pinstripes under the blue; behind the wing the blue carries light turquoise Polynesian tattoo motifs (a few turquoise vertical stripes first), and aft of the last door the body turns turquoise, crossed by broad blue arcs that sweep down from the crown and wrap the tail cone. 'AIR TAHITI NUI' in big white capitals over the forward windows, the first and last door framed as boxed letters. Blue fin with a big white tiare flower, turquoise bands near the tip (the top one carrying blue chevrons) and a turquoise arc at the root. White engines.",
